# Installed on top of the official Ubuntu 26.04 Desktop image for Raspberry Pi,
# which supplies GNOME, the standard desktop used when a monitor is connected.
# Installed with --no-install-recommends, so anything needed at runtime is listed.

# Touch session: a home screen modelled on Ubuntu Touch, built from these rather
# than from Ubuntu Touch itself. Its apps are the ones the desktop image ships.
sway
waybar
wvkbd
wlr-randr
grim

# Network and security
wireguard-tools
iptables
iw
openssh-server

# Calls
baresip-core

# First boot
cloud-guest-utils

# Fonts and Korean input for the desktop
fonts-noto-cjk
fonts-noto-color-emoji
ibus-hangul
